NativeSupporterVault::beginRecovery
├── Given unauthorized/repeated call or empty evidence commitment
│   └── It rejects
├── Given available custody
│   └── It snapshots B/Q/counters/ID boundary, quarantines surplus and exports exact Q to Safe
├── Given physical shortage
│   └── It attributes actual exported tokens proportionally, with deterministic atom remainder, never protocol priority
├── Given unavailable canonical valuation
│   └── It still exports native tokens without redemption, swaps or price dependencies
└── Given transfer failure
    └── It rolls back export, snapshot and freeze together; positions never become falsely paid
